                </td>
                <th>日&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;期：</th>
                <td>@DNS.Utilities.DateTimeHelper.GetDate(0)</td>
            </tr>
          
            <tr>
                <td colspan="4" valign="top">
                    <div>
                        <table id="tb_QuotationDetail" border="0" class="form-print" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
                            <tr>
                                <td align="center" style="border: 1px solid #000; width: 40px; text-align: center;">序号</td>
                                <td style="border: 1px solid #000; text-align: center;">品名</td>
                                <td style="border: 1px solid #000; text-align: center;">规格(厚*宽*长)</td>
                                <td style="border: 1px solid #000; text-align: center;">件数</td>
                                <td style="border: 1px solid #000; text-align: center;">重量</td>
                                <td style="border: 1px solid #000; text-align: center;">单价<br>(元/KG)</td>
                                <td name="WorkPrice" style="border: 1px solid #000; text-align: center;">加工费</td>
                                <td name="WorkPrice" style="border: 1px solid #000; text-align: center;">加工总额</td>
                                <td name="SmallCost" style="border: 1px solid #000; text-align: center;">加工费</td>
                                <td style="border: 1px solid #000; text-align: center;">金额</td>
                                <td style="border: 1px solid #000; text-align: center;">备注</td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td colspan="4">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;一、质量要求，技术标准，供方对质量负责的条件和期限按抚顺特钢公司相应产品的技术标准。</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td colspan="4">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;二、交货期：收到合同回传的五到七天。</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td colspan="4">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;三、质量问题处理需方在产品使用当中出现质量问题，经有关部门确认是供方产品质量问题，供方向需方赔偿方式是以料换料，不承担其他任何费用，待原材料已经报废，供方自行收回。</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td colspan="4">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;四、结算方式及期限：余下货款(&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;)在 @DNS.Utilities.DateTimeHelper.First25DayOfMonth()-25内付清；</td>
